From 65346890b7e9a183a523946250624691fda53719 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Hristov Yanev <icyhoty2k@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 12:01:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Feat: Shift+Enter in HistoryWnd spawns DirWnd (up to 3:
 left/right/center)

- Constants.h: add DIR_WND_MAX_INSTANCES=3 and DIR_WND_SPAWN_POSITIONS[]={4,2,0}
  slot 0 -> left strip  (position 4)
  slot 1 -> right strip (position 2)
  slot 2 -> center float (position 0)

- Shortcuts.h: document HISTORY_OPEN_IN_DIR_WND = VK_RETURN (requires Shift)

- UIManager.h: add std::array<DirWnd*,3> m_spawnedDirWnds, int m_nextSpawnSlot,
  SpawnDirWndForFolder(), HideAllSpawnedDirWnds()
  Primary (F5) DirWnd is untouched and fully independent.

- UIManager.cpp: implement SpawnDirWndForFolder (round-robin slot assignment,
  lazy alloc on first use, reuse oldest when all 3 occupied).
  HideAllPanelWindows() now also hides all spawned slots.
  getDirWindow() now explicitly passes CURRENT_DIR_WINDOW_POSITION.

- HistoryListWnd.cpp: VK_RETURN handler checks Shift:
  plain Enter -> original OpenDirectory + hide panel
  Shift+Enter -> SpawnDirWndForFolder, panel stays open
